#. module: account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account.field_account_journal__inbound_payment_method_line_ids
msgid ""
"Manual: Get paid by any method outside of Odoo.\n"
"Payment Providers: Each payment provider has its own Payment Method. Request a transaction on/to a card thanks to a payment token saved by the partner when buying or subscribing online.\n"
"Batch Deposit: Collect several customer checks at once generating and submitting a batch deposit to your bank. Module account_batch_payment is necessary.\n"
"SEPA Direct Debit: Get paid in the SEPA zone thanks to a mandate your partner will have granted to you. Module account_sepa is necessary.\n"
msgstr ""
"دستی: دریافت پرداخت از هر روشی خارج از مِنو.\n"
"درگاه‌های پرداخت: هر درگاه روش پرداخت مختص خود را دارد. امکان درخواست تراکنش به کمک توکن‌های ذخیره‌شده توسط مشتری هنگام خرید یا اشتراک آنلاین.\n"
"واریز دسته‌ای: جمع‌آوری چند چک مشتری و ارسال به صورت دسته‌ای به بانک (نیازمند ماژول account_batch_payment).\n"
"برداشت مستقیم SEPA: دریافت وجه در منطقه SEPA به واسطه دستور پرداخت مستقیم صادر شده از سوی مشتری (نیازمند ماژول account_sepa).\n"

#. module: account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account.field_account_journal__outbound_payment_method_line_ids
msgid ""
"Manual: Pay by any method outside of Odoo.\n"
"Check: Pay bills by check and print it from Odoo.\n"
"SEPA Credit Transfer: Pay in the SEPA zone by submitting a SEPA Credit Transfer file to your bank. Module account_sepa is necessary.\n"
msgstr ""
"دستی: پرداخت از طریق هر روشی خارج از مِنو.\n"
"چک: پرداخت صورت‌حساب‌ها با چک و چاپ آن از داخل مِنو.\n"
"انتقال اعتباری SEPA: پرداخت در منطقه SEPA با ارسال فایل انتقال اعتبار به بانک (نیازمند ماژول account_sepa).\n"

#. module: account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account.field_account_payment__payment_method_line_id
msgid ""
"Manual: Pay or Get paid by any method outside of Odoo.\n"
"Payment Providers: Each payment provider has its own Payment Method. Request a transaction on/to a card thanks to a payment token saved by the partner when buying or subscribing online.\n"
"Check: Pay bills by check and print it from Odoo.\n"
"Batch Deposit: Collect several customer checks at once generating and submitting a batch deposit to your bank. Module account_batch_payment is necessary.\n"
"SEPA Credit Transfer: Pay in the SEPA zone by submitting a SEPA Credit Transfer file to your bank. Module account_iso20022 is necessary.\n"
"SEPA Direct Debit: Get paid in the SEPA zone thanks to a mandate your partner will have granted to you. Module account_iso20022 is necessary.\n"
"U.S. ISO20022: Pay in the US by submitting an ISO20022 file to your bank. Module account_iso20022 is necessary.\n"
msgstr ""
"دستی: پرداخت یا دریافت وجه خارج از مِنو.\n"
"درگاه‌های پرداخت: استفاده از توکن پرداخت ذخیره‌شده مشتری.\n"
"چک: پرداخت صورت‌حساب با چک و چاپ آن.\n"
"واریز دسته‌ای: ارسال دسته‌ای چک‌ها به بانک (نیازمند ماژول account_batch_payment).\n"
"انتقال اعتباری SEPA و برداشت مستقیم SEPA (نیازمند ماژول account_iso20022).\n"
"استاندارد ISO20022 ایالات متحده (نیازمند ماژول account_iso20022).\n"

#. module: account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account.field_account_payment_register__payment_method_line_id
msgid ""
"Manual: Pay or Get paid by any method outside of Odoo.\n"
"Payment Providers: Each payment provider has its own Payment Method. Request a transaction on/to a card thanks to a payment token saved by the partner when buying or subscribing online.\n"
"Check: Pay bills by check and print it from Odoo.\n"
"Batch Deposit: Collect several customer checks at once generating and submitting a batch deposit to your bank. Module account_batch_payment is necessary.\n"
"SEPA Credit Transfer: Pay in the SEPA zone by submitting a SEPA Credit Transfer file to your bank. Module account_sepa is necessary.\n"
"SEPA Direct Debit: Get paid in the SEPA zone thanks to a mandate your partner will have granted to you. Module account_sepa is necessary.\n"
msgstr ""
"دستی: پرداخت یا دریافت وجه خارج از مِنو.\n"
